        "Hi! I’m Molly, I’ve helped thousands find relief from acid reflux, GERD, and LPR, inspired by my own struggles with GERD & IBS.",
        "“I know how you feel, because I‘ve been there myself.”",
        "After taking charge of my recovery through a sustainable approach of nutrition, lifestyle, and mind-body wellness, I recovered from severe IBS/GERD and reclaimed my health.",
        "Now, as a Gut Health Registered Dietitian, my mission is to help you find relief from acid reflux and digestive issues so you too can enjoy your favorite foods, feel amazing, and live with freedom.",
