        "★★★★★",
        "14.1k Empowered by FLORA™ Method",
        "We help people thrive.",
        "Molly has been a lifesaver in my healing journey. After countless doctors and medications, I was stressed and in constant pain. Finding Molly and the FLORA site changed everything. She created an easy plan for me, and now I’m off all medication and enjoying my favorite foods again. I’m recommending ",
        "“ I was diagnosed with Barrett’s esophagus earlier this year. Stage-4 GERD, but thankfully it was precancerous. I truly believe that FLORA saved my life. After just 1 month, I am experiencing virtually no reflux symptoms.” - Nathaniel M.",
        "“I can happily and honestly say that my life has done a 360. I have finally built a foundation for me to move forward in my life to be less scared of food and to know how to actually eat in a healthier and better way. \" - Corin G.",
